  "text": "You are wearing a long khaki slip dress that falls straight from the V-neck to your ankles, creating a soft vertical line. The outfit is accessorized with a small white twilly tied at your wrist and a floral-patterned crossbody bag in navy blue with golden lilies. You have paired this relaxed look with low-profile khaki sneakers that add comfort without breaking the casual vibe.",
  "how_to_wear": [
    "Tie the thin scarf around your wrist for a touch of color near your hand, or loop it gently into your hair to keep cool in the morning sunlight.",
    "The loose slip dress lets you move freely for yoga, while the sneakers handle any walk outside without feeling restrictive."
  ],
